 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Point:** A structure containing spatial coordinates $(x, y, z)$ and a shading value $s$ (color or intensity).
-*   **View:** A collection of Points. For 3D DVR, points are voxels; for 2D, points are pixels or bins.
